    "content": "The AI Tutor for MBA Students proposes to deliver significant value through personalized learning support, enhanced academic integrity, and improved learning efficiency and accessibility. It is hypothesized that MBA students will benefit from tailored assistance that adapts to their individual learning pace and style, addressing the general demand for personalization in education. The solution will also integrate robust features and clear guidelines to mitigate concerns about AI misuse and plagiarism, fostering trust among students and institutions. By offering immediate and flexible support, the AI Tutor aims to make learning more efficient and accessible, complementing existing academic resources. However, the specific unmet needs, urgency, and willingness to pay among MBA students for such a service remain unconfirmed.",
